    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Forging Rings<br></li><li>Enchantment system based on Nutrition<br></li><li>A Not-so-serious Serious Game<br></li><li>Quirky Sound Effects</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create high-quality rings!</h2>&quot;Master, we want to be smarter,&quot; &quot;No problem!&quot; (add some salmon)<br>&quot;Master, I want to be stronger,&quot; &quot;No problem&quot; (pour in some milk)<br>&quot;Master, I want to improve resistance,&quot; &quot;No problem&quot; (add some chili)<br>&quot;Master, why does the sound of forging rings sound like cooking?&quot; &quot;Oh, that's the new technique!&quot;",
